<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pep Boys EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pep Boys EPS view cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- EVEREN Securities Inc, citing unseasonal weather, especially in California, said Wednesday it lowered its fourth quarter earnings per share estimate on Pep Boys to $0.37 from $0.43. This takes its FY97 EPS estimate to $1.63 from $1.69.</p>
<p>-- EVEREN also trimmed its FY98 estimate on the automotive parts seller to $1.98 from $2.04 and said price weakness is viewed as a buying opportunity.</p>
<p>-- Pep Boys was trading at 31-1/4, off 1/4.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
